      Four source files, one flattened tree, and a second device tree entirely
      &mdash; U-Boot&rsquo;s &mdash; that runs first and leaves the pin multiplexer
      in a state the kernel simply inherits. Our board file is a third sibling of
      the two reference boards, not a modification of either.
    </p>

